{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17209","headline":"奉酬张监阁老雪後过中书见赠加两韵简南省僚旧 · 权德舆","name":"奉酬张监阁老雪後过中书见赠加两韵简南省僚旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寓直久叨荣，新恩倍若惊。\n风清五夜永，节换一阳生。\n潘鬓年空长，齐竽艺本轻。\n常时望连茹，今日剧悬旌。\n枉步欢方接，含毫思又萦。\n烦君白雪句，岁晏若爲情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}